Test session resumption based on session ticket

Procedure:
- After successful handshake, re-run the client.

Security events:
- notice: TLS handshake successfully performed

Expected:
- Client successfully reconnects to the server using session ticket from
  the initial handshake.

Assertion:
-  after second successful handshake, tunnel outputs:
   [DEBUG] session reuse 1
   (tunnel is run with `-l DEBUG`)